{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Aikatsu on Parade! (ONA)","\"Dream School Grand Prix\" to decide the No.1 idol school among five schools representing the Aikatsu world will be held! In this competition where top idols representing each school compete on stage, Dream Academy's new idol Noel Otoshiro is selected as one of them?! For each idol's dream, a new story starts running into the shining future! \n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)"],"ja":["アイカツオンパレード！(ONA)",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":40266,"relation":"prequel"}],"id":"mal-41555","ids":{"shikimori":41555,"mal":41555,"anilist":116979,"kodik":"serial-42979"},"kodikIds":["serial-42979"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-42979":"2022-05-18T08:41:18Z"},"title":"Айкацу на параде! ONA","originalTitle":"Aikatsu on Parade! Dream Story","alt":"Айкацу на параде! ONA / Aikatsu on Parade! (ONA) アイカツオンパレード！(ONA)","description":"Состоится \"Гран-при школы мечты\", который определит школу айдолов №1 среди пяти школ, представляющих мир Айкацу! В этом конкурсе, где лучшие айдолы, представляющие каждую школу, соревнуются на сцене, новый айдол Dream Academy Ноэль Отосиро выбран в качестве одного из них?! Для мечты каждого айдола начинается новая история, ведущая в сияющее будущее!","year":2020,"type":"ONA","genres":["Повседневность","идолы жен","Музыка","Школа"],"rating":6.77,"popularity":1691,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[40266],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/41555/4c65bcadac4ede9dcfad843274ee14d9.jpeg","width":400,"height":557},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/a8cfa024ad9e604fcd30b04832f85f162505bf85.jpg","width":1280,"height":720}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":6,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-869","dubId":"869","label":"Субтитры","language":"ja","original":true,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","rel